2-BEDROOM APARTMENT | BALCONY | GARAGE | ENERGY RATING: A | THERMAL COMFORT

Located in Vila Nova de Poiares, this modern 2-bedroom ground-floor apartment, featuring a private enclosed garage for two cars, has been designed for those seeking a high quality of life.

Whether as a permanent residence or an investment opportunity, this property offers the chance to enjoy a peaceful location, with excellent access to Coimbra and surrounded by the natural beauty of the region.

FEATURES:

- One master suite;

- One additional bedroom;

- Two bathrooms;

- Open-plan living room and kitchen;

- Fully fitted and equipped kitchen;

- Balcony with a gross area of 16 m²;

- Private garage for two cars.

LOCATION AND SURROUNDINGS

Situated in Vila Nova de Poiares, this property benefits from a practical and convenient location, in an area with shops, services and restaurants nearby.

The surrounding area offers easy access to supermarkets, pharmacies, cafés and other essential everyday services, allowing you to enjoy both convenience and tranquillity.

Its proximity to National Road N17 also provides excellent accessibility and convenient connections to other towns and villages in the region.

Don't miss this opportunity to enjoy a high quality of life in one of the most peaceful areas of the region, just a few minutes from Coimbra.

Book your viewing today and come discover what could be your next home. We look forward to welcoming you!

Other options available: Additional 2-bedroom and 3-bedroom apartments are also available in the building.

